WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:06,310
The third and fourth floors were all flooded.

2
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:16,650
Fortunately, someone saw the flood at the window and called Zhang Pinghao in advance. Are they awake yet?

3
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,490
Look at the little animals for a while

4
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:20,770
Mom is next to me

5
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:48,370
one missing

6
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,790
When the flood comes, we all run to higher ground

7
00:00:54,790 --> 00:00:55,710
Your son is falling behind

8
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:57,230
It was washed away by the water. You are talking nonsense.

9
00:00:57,230 --> 00:00:59,060
Go out with you alone

10
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,360
We can't come back

11
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:02,640
Before we set off, I told him that he didn't know how to swim and it was best not to go.

12
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:08,250
It was he who insisted on following

13
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:09,570
Don't say this nonsense

14
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:11,890
When the flood came, everyone was running away. They all saw it.

15
00:01:11,890 --> 00:01:13,010
I leave these to you

16
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:14,890
We can deal with other matters after the disaster has passed.
